  "label": "dog as innocent metaphor",
  "description": "The image of a dog, often perceived as innocent and harmless, is used as a visual metaphor for an individual who is unaware or unpenalized for using a racially charged slur. This false equivalence is a key element of the meme's hateful intent, as it suggests that the offense is trivial and that the person is not to blame.",
